# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 与 Linux 之间产生整文件级的伪差异
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须用 CRLF，否则可能无法执行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换，也不参与文本差异比较
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp3 binary
*.bin binary
*.pt binary
*.onnx binary

# 锁定文件在 diff 中不显示，减少噪音
requirements*.txt text
*.lock binary
